    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly, adjust pH to 9.0 with NaOH and autoclave under a N2 atmosphere. After cooling, replace the gas phase with a N2--CO2 (4:1,v/v) gas mixture. Add the following solutions from sterile anaerobic stocks (autoclaved and stored under a N2 atmosphere):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Check final pH be around 8.5."
    }
